1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,500
Connections is a personals list for people on Are.na.

2
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:07,500
Meet through what you collect and create—

3
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:12,000
for friendship, collaboration, romance, or just someone new to talk to.

4
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:14,500
If you know Are.na, you know.

5
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:18,500
It’s where I go for visual research, good books, hot sites.

6
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:21,000
Sometimes solo, sometimes with friends.

7
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:24,000
But the people make it what it is.

8
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:28,500
There’s been a longstanding joke that Are.na should have a dating app.

9
00:00:28,500 --> 00:00:32,000
Connections is for finding friendship, collaboration,

10
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:35,000
and all that based on Are.na collections.

11
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:38,000
No algorithm, and no upgrades

12
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:43,000
because it only took six hours to make and runs on Are.na itself.

13
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:48,500
You connect your account and answer some prompts with blocks and channels.

14
00:00:48,500 --> 00:00:51,500
Sort of a window into your mind.

15
00:00:51,500 --> 00:00:55,000
Send someone a message, and it opens a private Are.na channel

16
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:58,000
for just the two of you.

17
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:01,000
Meet someone, see what develops.

18
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:04,000
I hope you have fun with it.
